What does mophead mean?
Mophead means a person with
Thick Bushy hair.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The end of a mop, to which the [[thrums]] or [[rags]] are fastened.
# {{lb|en|US}} A [[clamp]] for holding the thrums or rags of a mop.
# A type of thick rounded haircut similar to that worn by {{w|The Beatles|the Beatles}} in the early 1960s.
# {{lb|en|pejorative}} A person with unkempt hair that stands away from the head.

